# vvaharness/pipeline/stages/s8/validate.py

Deterministic gates over a chain the model proposed. They only drop or annotate a chain, never promote it: same-location collapse, citation resolution, link coverage, comment-line citations, title divergence, hedge detection, the severity lift gate, identical-chain merge and near-duplicate relation, and feeds claims no chain carries.

